        <mxCell id="n34" parent="n9" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="A scheduled order is not on this path. It stays pending until LLD 5. cancelled is LLD 6. Create-fail fallback is synchronous. The no-rider wait is the sweeper, LLD 4." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="292" width="1900" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n35" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n36" parent="n35" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="order.events accepted {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string order_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string quote_id = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string customer_id = 3;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string store_id = 4;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;// no address, no phone (P-24)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;delivery.events dispatched {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string delivery_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string order_id = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string provider = 3;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int32 attempt = 4;&lt;br&gt;}" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n37" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n38" parent="n37" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;deliveries&lt;/b&gt; — delivery_id, brand_id, order_id, quote_id, status=dispatching, attempt, provider_account_id, provider_ref, version.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;delivery_status&lt;/b&gt; — one row, status, at.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;outbox&lt;/b&gt; — delivery.events dispatched.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;processed_event&lt;/b&gt; — the order.events version." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n39" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n40" parent="n39" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Facts dedupe on version. A repeat of the same accepted is an Ack.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Provider Create uses delivery_id as the idempotency key, so a retry does not open two jobs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Identity deadline is the remaining time of the consumer, which has no caller. Budget is the app timeout." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n41" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n42" parent="n41" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• P-19: the store list, then the brand default. First create that succeeds wins.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• P-21: dispatch starts at accepted, not at placed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• P-24: the address is read here, not off the bus.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O-14: when every provider fails, Order hears delivery.events{failed} and the business has not said whether that cancels the order." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
