        <mxCell id="n38" parent="n37" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• P-12: integer satang. No floats.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• P-25: the payout leaves in this commit. Payment moves the money.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A missing scheme is visible (amount 0, flagged). It is not a silent skip." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
