        <mxCell id="n22" parent="n9" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="The HR export cron writes a file to S3. It does not call Humanica. There is no outbox, because no other domain reacts. A claim is an adjust with a ticket reference (P-28), not a Zendesk webhook." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="292" width="1900" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n23" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n24" parent="n23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc SetTier(SetTierRequest) returns (Tier);&lt;br&gt;rpc UpsertIncentive(...) returns (...);&lt;br&gt;rpc RecordInstallment(...) returns (...);&lt;br&gt;rpc AdjustEarning(AdjustRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (Earning);&lt;br&gt;AdjustRequest carries reason,&lt;br&gt;amount_satang, and ticket_ref." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n26" parent="n25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;tiers&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;incentive_programs&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;installments&lt;/b&gt;, or one &lt;b&gt;earnings&lt;/b&gt; row of kind=adjust.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;audit&lt;/b&gt; — in the same commit. Not a topic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The export cron writes a file and a row in &lt;b&gt;exports&lt;/b&gt; (key, at)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n27" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n28" parent="n27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• version on tiers, programs, and installments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• AdjustEarning: idempotency_key. A repeat returns the first row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The export cron is safe to run twice: the file key includes the date." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n29" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n30" parent="n29" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• P-27: reports are this export plus the data-lake sink. No app reads this database to build a report.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• P-28: ticket_ref is a string CSC types. We do not open the ticket.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Equipment installments are a balance on the rider, not a second ledger." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
