        <mxCell id="n23" parent="n9" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Ops sees flagged rows in admin. No money moves, no second payment.requested, no outbox. A late paid_out still settles the row through LLD 13 and clears the flag." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="292" width="1900" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n24" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n25" parent="n24" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="No new message. Reads earnings where&lt;br&gt;kind = trip and&lt;br&gt;(payout_status = sending and&lt;br&gt; updated_at older than the window)&lt;br&gt;or payout_status = failed." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n26" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n27" parent="n26" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;earnings&lt;/b&gt; — needs_review = true. Amount and payout_status unchanged.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;audit&lt;/b&gt; — one row per flag, same commit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No outbox. No processed_event. This is a cron." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n28" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n29" parent="n28" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Setting needs_review twice is a no-op.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Kubernetes CronJob, Forbid, Asia/Bangkok (P-07). Safe to run twice." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n30" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n31" parent="n30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• P-25: Payment owns the money. This cron only says which trips have no answer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The window and what ops does with a failed payout are open (O-16).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Same cron box as the shift file (LLD 11) and the HR export (LLD 14)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
